# Shell scripts the tool emits must stay LF in this repository. They are embedded as
# resources, so a CRLF checkout would travel into every generated layer and break bash on
# any adopter's Linux CI. ScaffoldPlan normalises .sh output as well; this keeps the source
# honest so the two never disagree.
*.sh.tmpl text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
